# Formatting
- Use 4 spaces for indentation.
- Keep the heading levels H1 by default.
    Bad:
    ```markdown
    # Overall file title

    ## Section title 1
    Foo

    ## Section title 2
    Bar

    ### Section 2 subsection
    Baz
    ```

    Good:
    ```markdown
    # Overall file title

    # Section title 1
    Foo

    # Section title 2
    Bar

    ## Section 2 subsection
    Baz
    ```

- Don't leave a blank line after a heading.
    - Exception: the heading is the overall file title.
    - Exception: I asked you to leave space for me to fill in the section.  In that case leave 2 blank lines after the section heading.
